//RS //! Host shims for `core.sys`, `core.log`, `core.math`, and `core.files`,
//RS //! plus `core.sys` and `core.process` CoreCalls (#729). Behavior
//RS //! mirrors AOT helpers in the CoreLib prelude (`jet_std_os_*`, `jet_ring_log_*`,
//RS //! `jet_std_math_*`, `jet_std_fs_*`, `jet_std_path_*`, `jet_std_env_*`,
//RS //! `jet_std_process_*`) — thin std wrappers, not a third algorithm.
//RS //! parity: guard tests/dev_tier_parity.rs::io_cli_terminal_and_time_match_interpreter_jit_and_aot
//RS 
//RS // This module includes shared Prelude source that several hosts compile,
//RS // each using a different subset, so dead-code reports here are about the
//RS // other hosts' usage, not about this one. Scoped to the module, never the crate.
//RS #![allow(dead_code)]
